scn 1
# explore-idle-ulasem (perf follow-up D, timing only): the map-sized part of World::updateExplorationPlane on
# the largest shipped map, Ulasem Arena (640x640, exploration plane 320x320 = 102400 cells; the WE timing
# situations' map), with 16 idle bodies at two start positions: after the first tick no footprint changes
# cell, so SIMPHASE explore= is what the pass costs whatever the units do. Needs --data.
# Run with tools/scenarios/perf-explore/run.sh or wall.sh (base vs candidate on the timing cores).
